<title>UK: Lang leaves Liberty for Asprey. [CORRECTED 14:30 GMT]</title>
<headline>Lang leaves Liberty for Asprey. [CORRECTED 14:30 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK jeweller Asprey said on Wednesday that Geoffrey Lang will take over from Tim Cooper as managing director on April 21.</p>
<p>Asprey said that Lang was group managing director, Liberty textiles and branded products divisions.</p>
<p>(Corrects Lang's position).</p>
<p>Cooper will retire at the end of the year.</p>
<p>-London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
